<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Nine precious names of Sarasotans with homes in Toxie. We printed out the list and then stared at it. And then we stared at the phone.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>九个珍贵的萨拉索塔人的名字，他们在托克茜里拥有房屋。我们把名单打印出来，然后盯着它看。接着我们盯着电话。

