<v David Kestenbaum>Hi, George and Sylvia, this is David Kestenbaum, I'm a reporter with National Public Radio. I'm calling to-- I'm calling to see if you own or purchased--
<v David Kestenbaum>嗨，乔治和西尔维娅，我是大卫·克斯滕鲍姆，我是国家公共广播电台的记者。我打电话是想——我打电话是想看看你是否拥有或购买了——

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:53.260
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>You sound nervous.
