<v Chana Joffe-Walt>It says their house is on the corner--
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>上面说他们的房子在拐角处——

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:05.500
<v David Kestenbaum>1792.
<v David Kestenbaum>1792.

